  "solution": "[IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/b968da625e3936f9364a60f4ec3bdc8f1d4b1d1db9850270d1f3b4f0822dfd51.png] \n\nLet's check each option,\n\n**1) 7 and 6**\n\n→ 27 × 3 – (6)2 + 19 + **(69 ÷ 23)** × 7 – 15 = 70 \n\n→ **27 × 3** – (6)2 + 19 + **3 × 7** – 15 = 70 \n\n→ **81** – (6)2 **+ 19 + 21** – 15 = 70\n\n→ **121 – (6****)****2** – 15 = 70\n\n→ 85 – 15 = 70\n\n→ 70 = 70\n\n→ **LHS = RHS ⇒ Satisfies the equation.**\n\n**2) 19 and 15**\n\n→ 27 × 3 – (7)² + 15 + **(69 ÷ 23)** × 6 – 19 = 70 \n\n→ **27 × 3** – 49 + 15 + **3 × 6** – 19 = 70 \n\n→ **81** – 49 **+ 15 + 18** – 19 = 70 \n\n→ 114 – 49 – 19 = 70 \n\n→ 46 ≠ 70\n\n→ **LHS ≠ RHS**\n\n**3) 3 and 7**\n\n→ 27 × 7 – (3)2 + 19 + **(69 ÷ 23)** × 6 – 15 = 70 \n\n→ **27 × 7** – 9 + 19 + **3 × 6** – 15 = 70 \n\n→ **189** – 9 **+ 19 + 18** – 15 = 70 \n\n→ 127 – 9 – 15 = 70 \n\n→ 103 ≠ 70\n\n→ **LHS ≠ RHS**\n\n**4) 3 and 6**\n\n→ 27 × 6 – (7)2 + 19 + **(69 ÷ 23)** × 3 – 15 = 70 \n\n→ **27 × 6** – (7)2 + 19 + **3 × 3** – 15 = 70 \n\n→ **162** – 49 **+ 19 + 9** – 15 = 70 \n\n→ 190 – 49 – 15 = 70 \n\n→ 126 ≠ 70\n\n→ **LHS ≠ RHS**\n\nHere, we can see that only Option 1 satisfies the logic.\n\nHence, the correct answer is **\"7 and 6\"**.",
